{"4566500": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "OnlyAliens", "steam_appid": 4566500, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Livestream. Expose aliens. Make money.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You and up to 5 friends are one viral clip away from fame! Aliens are hiding in society and they're very good content. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your job: find them, expose them, and film the whole thing for OnlyAliens, the only platform paying top dollar for real alien footage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fame or death. Whatever makes good content.    </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FIND ALIENS </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not everyone in the crowd is what they seem. Interview civilians, ragebait the suspicious ones, and run them through your gadgets to find the impostors. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4566500/extras/c7352b54df909c1f4c4f5e9d1dc70a0d.poster.avif?t=1788156790\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4566500/extras/c7352b54df909c1f4c4f5e9d1dc70a0d.webm?t=1788156790\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4566500/extras/c7352b54df909c1f4c4f5e9d1dc70a0d.mp4?t=1788156790\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>...BUT MOST OF THEM ARE NOT ALIENS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Most of the crowd are humans. If you harass too many regular humans, the cops show up. They'll flood the area and hunt you down, or worse... stop the content! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4566500/extras/4af7d753e917b54a1bf6bbaa1016a210.poster.avif?t=1788156790\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4566500/extras/4af7d753e917b54a1bf6bbaa1016a210.webm?t=1788156790\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4566500/extras/4af7d753e917b54a1bf6bbaa1016a210.mp4?t=1788156790\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>RECORD EVERYTHING</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once an alien reveals its true form, the city erupts into chaos. Work together   to hold the creature off long enough to keep filming. Every player has their own camera, so everyone can record the action at any time. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>The better your footage, the bigger the rewards.</i></strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4566500/extras/78b97d22efe3031984073688047b6f7c.poster.avif?t=1788156790\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4566500/extras/78b97d22efe3031984073688047b6f7c.webm?t=1788156790\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4566500/extras/78b97d22efe3031984073688047b6f7c.mp4?t=1788156790\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>1 to 6 player online co-op</strong> with everyone able to record their own footage</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hunt shape shifting aliens hidden among crowds of NPCs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use unique detection gadgets to identify the real aliens</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hold off deadly alien attacks with  items</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn money and clout from viral streams to unlock new gear and cosmetics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic police system that punishes collateral damage and false accusations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless unpredictable moments built for hilarious friend group chaos</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Secure the bag, don't get caught, and stream OnlyAliens!</strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Livestream. Expose aliens. Make money.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You and up to 5 friends are one viral clip away from fame! Aliens are hiding in society and they're very good content. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your job: find them, expose them, and film the whole thing for OnlyAliens, the only platform paying top dollar for real alien footage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fame or death. Whatever makes good content.    </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FIND ALIENS </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not everyone in the crowd is what they seem. Interview civilians, ragebait the suspicious ones, and run them through your gadgets to find the impostors. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4566500/extras/c7352b54df909c1f4c4f5e9d1dc70a0d.poster.avif?t=1788156790\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4566500/extras/c7352b54df909c1f4c4f5e9d1dc70a0d.webm?t=1788156790\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4566500/extras/c7352b54df909c1f4c4f5e9d1dc70a0d.mp4?t=1788156790\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><